{"source": "wacg51", "article_key": "276812", "url": "https://51cg1.com/archives/276812/", "title": "池州学院 999送花事件 已婚男无缝衔接 网红锦鲤小灏 后者专约富二代尽毁三观！ 热搜 HOT", "published_at": "2026-09-26", "html": "<div class=\"post-content\" itemprop=\"articleBody\">\n\n<div class=\"line\" style=\"margin-top: 0\"></div>\n<p>池州学院999送花事件，直接把浪漫送花整成大型社死现场！有人在校园里搞了999朵玫瑰那种大场面，送花那位丁勇不是什么纯情学长，是已婚男。无缝衔接的新对象是抖音网红锦鲤小灏，圈里传她专约富二代，专挑钱包厚的贴。一边是已婚男还在用999送花演深情，一边是网红人设专盯二代资源，两个人一对接，不妥妥的狗男女吗。</p><p><img alt=\"池州学院 999送花事件 1\" src=\"wacg51/276812/img-6a9ed38d204b.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"池州学院 999送花事件 2\" src=\"wacg51/276812/img-ca6e4f7fe61d.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"池州学院 999送花事件 3\" src=\"wacg51/276812/img-c48c1ec58ec2.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"池州学院 999送花事件 4\" src=\"wacg51/276812/img-796afa6df39c.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"池州学院 999送花事件 5\" src=\"wacg51/276812/img-1518a4cc73c5.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"池州学院 999送花事件 6\" src=\"wacg51/276812/img-604f0ffbce9b.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"池州学院 999送花事件 7\" src=\"wacg51/276812/img-4d00da0b1a64.jpg\"/></p><h2>约炮身份全翻车</h2><p>999送花还只是开胃菜。后面更炸的是约炮被曝光、身份被扒穿。丁勇这边不是单纯送花，聊天记录、开房暗示、约时间地点那一套都被截图甩出来了。锦鲤小灏那边也不干净，网红人设一拆，专约富二代、专挑有车有房的局被一起挂了出来。</p><p><img alt=\"池州学院 999送花事件 8\" src=\"wacg51/276812/img-af081e30d3b1.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"池州学院 999送花事件 9\" src=\"wacg51/276812/img-c9b6cfdcf9bb.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"池州学院 999送花事件 10\" src=\"wacg51/276812/img-5d9f69bb07c0.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"池州学院 999送花事件 11\" src=\"wacg51/276812/img-6348e0dd60d0.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"池州学院 999送花事件 12\" src=\"wacg51/276812/img-04e373f75dc4.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"池州学院 999送花事件 13\" src=\"wacg51/276812/img-625801f8b217.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"池州学院 999送花事件 14\" src=\"wacg51/276812/img-411c506596b5.jpg\"/></p><h2>浪漫滤镜碎得比花瓣还快</h2><p>999送花是壳，已婚是雷，无缝衔接是加速器，锦鲤小灏专约富二代是最后一刀。细节越扒越离谱，送花当天围观的人又拍照又发墙，鲜花还没蔫，人就已经换赛道了。你说这叫恋爱？这叫他妈的当众献丑！三观直接碎一地！</p> \n\n\n\n<!-- 热闻区 -->\n\n<!-- 官方公告 -->\n\n</div>", "images": [{"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260926/2026092616264683328.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/276812/img-6a9ed38d204b.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260926/2026092616265267628.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/276812/img-ca6e4f7fe61d.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260926/2026092616265536924.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/276812/img-c48c1ec58ec2.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260926/2026092616265958141.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/276812/img-796afa6df39c.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260926/2026092616270382613.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/276812/img-1518a4cc73c5.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260926/2026092616270914095.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/276812/img-604f0ffbce9b.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260926/2026092616271262302.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/276812/img-4d00da0b1a64.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260926/2026092616285263522.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/276812/img-af081e30d3b1.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260926/2026092616272583655.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/276812/img-c9b6cfdcf9bb.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260926/2026092616272882882.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/276812/img-5d9f69bb07c0.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260926/2026092616273196983.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/276812/img-6348e0dd60d0.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260926/2026092616273380095.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/276812/img-04e373f75dc4.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260926/2026092616273566717.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/276812/img-625801f8b217.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260926/2026092616273542863.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/276812/img-411c506596b5.jpg"}]}